Unofficial Essentia.js WebAssembly builds
========================================

This repository packages automated builds of Essentia.js (the WebAssembly
bindings for the Essentia C++ audio analysis library) for convenience. The
underlying project is maintained by the Music Technology Group at Universitat
Pompeu Fabra and is available at:

  https://github.com/MTG/essentia.js

All source code and binary artifacts in this repository remain licensed under
the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3. See LICENSE for the full
terms. Any commercial licensing options must be negotiated with the upstream
project.

Upstream attributions
---------------------

* Essentia.js (AGPL-3.0) — JavaScript/WebAssembly bindings for Essentia.
* Essentia (AGPL-3.0) — the underlying C++ audio analysis library.

The exact upstream commit, build tooling, and environment information for each
artifact is recorded in build-info.json.
